  "subtitle": "Moroccan braised chicken with green olives and lemon",
  "excerpt": "This Moroccan-style braise uses fresh lemon in place of preserved lemon, which gives a brighter, fresher result that still carries the dish's characteristic citrus punch. Saffron and warm spices round out a deeply flavoured pot.",
