  "sourceNotes": "Chicken with preserved lemon and olives, djaj bil hamad mraquad, is a cornerstone of Moroccan home cooking and appears across the country's city medinas and family tables. The combination of salt-preserved citrus with green olives is one of the defining flavour pairings of Moroccan cuisine.",
